# ==============================================================================
# ServiceMan Fullstack Environment Reference Guide
# ==============================================================================
# ServiceMan uses two isolated environment files:
# 1. server/.env (Backend: Port, MongoDB, JWT, Razorpay Server Secret, S3)
# 2. client/.env (Frontend: API URL, WebSockets, Razorpay Public Key, Google Maps)
#
# Quick setup:
#   copy server\.env.example server\.env
#   copy client\.env.example client\.env
#
# Both files are already initialized with functional free-tier and sandbox fallbacks!
